    "message": "Index a long computation's saves in another process\n\nA computation with at least eight saves sends each save's new records to one\nindexing process (storage/index_writer.py), which ingests them in order while\nthe computation goes on. Only what ingest reads is sent; a send that does not\nstart at the index's offsets is refused. The computation waits when the index\nis two saves behind and, at its end, until every save is indexed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
